Package: backgammonboard
Title: Represent and Render Backgammon Positions
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Marty", "Gale",
    email = "justsendityew@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Copyright: 2026 Marty Gale
Description: Creates validated factual backgammon position objects from complete
    'eXtreme Gammon' identifiers (XGIDs) and, when the optional
    'backgammoncalculator' package is installed, complete 'GNU Backgammon'
    identifiers (GNUIDs). Provides static 'ggplot2' board rendering, display
    transforms, cube, dice, score, and checker-movement rendering. Factual
    position state is kept separate from display context; the package does not
    evaluate strategy or certify complete-play legality. The optional
    'backgammoncalculator' package is available from
    <https://github.com/backgammonsimplified/backgammoncalculator>.
License: AGPL-3
URL: https://backgammonsimplified.github.io/about/backgammonboard/, https://github.com/backgammonsimplified/backgammonboard
BugReports: https://github.com/backgammonsimplified/backgammonboard/issues
